{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"media","input":{"id":302051,"type":"tv"},"checkedAt":1793643206384,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":302051,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/302051","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T18:13:16.461Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"I Became a Legend after My 10 Year-Long Last Stand","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"ここは俺に任せて先に行けと言ってから10年がたったら伝説になっていた。","overview":{"value":"Luck, un mago di grado S del gruppo dell'eroe, affronta da solo il Re dei Demoni in un'ultima, disperata difesa per salvare i suoi compagni. Quando finalmente fa ritorno vittorioso, sono passati dieci anni e il mondo lo acclama come un eroe leggendario morto in battaglia. Impossibilitato a riprendersi la sua vecchia vita, Luck nasconde la propria identità e ricomincia da capo come \"Lock\", un avventuriero di grado F pronto a costruirsi un futuro in un mondo che è andato avanti senza di lui.","language":"it-IT"},"startDate":"2026-07-06","endDate":"2026-09-21","status":"Ended","mediaType":"Preparato","rating":6.917,"ratingCount":24,"contentScore":94,"numberOfEpisodes":12,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["Animazione","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Action & Adventure"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Nome Originale":"ここは俺に任せて先に行けと言ってから10年がたったら伝説になっていた。","Stato":"Terminato","Tipo":"Preparato","Lingua Originale":"Giapponese"},"keywords":["self sacrifice","hero","anime","time displacement","based on light novel","heroic sacrifice","presumed dead return"],"networks":[{"id":614,"name":"TOKYO MX","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hSdroyVthq3CynxTIIY7lnS8w1.png"}],"socialLinks":{"twitter":"https://x.com/kokoore_anime","justwatch":"https://www.justwatch.com/us/tv-show/i-became-a-legend-after-my-10-year-long-last-stand","homepage":"https://kokoore-anime.com"},"cast":[{"id":1919881,"name":"Gakuto Kajiwara","role":"Luck \"Lock\" Franzen (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kUer38jXf7vTD2TGGxJMZVYL5Te.jpg"},{"id":9706,"name":"Toshiyuki Morikawa","role":"Eric Imgard Mendirival (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hrzGBe4nokgkBNFekNo5hlXB2Bv.jpg"},{"id":1251325,"name":"Tsuyoshi Koyama","role":"Goran Morton (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xm7AT3bF4ARZvbx87ixXT8rNFgs.jpg"},{"id":1224288,"name":"Yui Ishikawa","role":"(voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zptGIN1iklKJL1xrfHKOpxR2qJ9.jpg"},{"id":2409802,"name":"Mayu Sagara","role":"(voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rKam75qicpfKqfrSNhTe84ZcfeM.jpg"},{"id":1161472,"name":"Mao Ichimichi","role":"(voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a3cflYtrlFK0LXfWODgLDO7E7CP.jpg"},{"id":2380499,"name":"Yurie Kozakai","role":"(voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mbIMcptHLQir3wrAnnSSAR5uRR1.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"I Became a Legend after My 10 Year-Long Last Stand","overview":"Luck, un mago di grado S del gruppo dell'eroe, affronta da solo il Re dei Demoni in un'ultima, disperata difesa per salvare i suoi compagni. Quando finalmente fa ritorno vittorioso, sono passati dieci anni e il mondo lo acclama come un eroe leggendario morto in battaglia. Impossibilitato a riprendersi la sua vecchia vita, Luck nasconde la propria identità e ricomincia da capo come \"Lock\", un avventuriero di grado F pronto a costruirsi un futuro in un mondo che è andato avanti senza di lui."},{"language":"en-US","title":"I Became a Legend After My 10 Year-Long Last Stand","overview":"Luck, an S-rank mage in the hero's party, makes a last stand against the Demon King to save his companions. When he finally returns victorious, ten years have passed, and the world praises him as a legendary hero who died in battle. Unable to reclaim his former life, Luck conceals his identity and begins again as \"Lock,\" an F-rank adventurer forging a future in a world that moved on without him."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"勇者パーティのSランク魔導士ラックは勇者エリック、戦士ゴランとともに次元の狭間で魔神王を倒すために激しい戦いを繰り広げていた。仲間の全滅を避けるため、ラックはたった一人で敵と戦い続ける決意をし叫ぶ。「ここは俺に任せて先に行け!」想像を絶する孤独な戦いを続け、ついに魔神王をも倒したラック。しかし、彼が元の世界へ帰還した時には「10年」という歳月が過ぎ、ラックは自らを犠牲に世界を救った大英雄として伝説となっていた。戦いの影響で見た目が若返ったラックは正体を隠し、かつての仲間と新たな仲間たちとともにFランク冒険者ロックとして生きていく。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vrOw9zfO4go3r4RGICjg3UmWVwo.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vrOw9zfO4go3r4RGICjg3UmWVwo.png","language":"en","width":1192,"height":575},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8GFUjTWVvCCHn39huAy4UdTf18V.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8GFUjTWVvCCHn39huAy4UdTf18V.png","language":"ja","width":1800,"height":657}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4LaPshxWTFcBhc5ib8xOfYeD9tH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4LaPshxWTFcBhc5ib8xOfYeD9tH.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nNO7is6vM82oocyYg18RNHpc2yk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nNO7is6vM82oocyYg18RNHpc2yk.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v1qWtWt9sYOabDgzcztsYb9hH73.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v1qWtWt9sYOabDgzcztsYb9hH73.jpg","language":"ja","width":1456,"height":2184},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/svcJyWDhj1STkOTSfxgd2hOvZ0z.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/svcJyWDhj1STkOTSfxgd2hOvZ0z.jpg","language":"ja","width":1500,"height":2122},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xxwwjwn03bfEOZmJncBt1TCtL4D.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xxwwjwn03bfEOZmJncBt1TCtL4D.jpg","language":"xx","width":700,"height":1000}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g4yyesQhnQ5KH2k6eCXHMHPwl1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb